  Description: Mirror a Lens scene in your browser, record what happens while it plays and edit the recording into a video. Web Capture syncs the captured objects to a portal served by its Lens Studio plugin (or through Snap Cloud), saves light keyframe recordings (webcapture/1 JSON) and ships a self-contained web portal to replay, re-frame, trim, add titles and music, and export MP4/WebM.
